==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card is almost identical to {{TCG ID|Champion's Path|Swablu|48}} from the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]]'s {{TCG|Champion's Path}} expansion, except for the {{TCG|Weakness}} modifier and {{TCG|Resistance}}; both cards feature the same illustration.
*{{m|Peck}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Swablu}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

